# --- Agent context & permissions -------------------------------------------
# COMMITTED on purpose: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/decisions/, and every
# .claude/settings.json — including the per-workspace-package copies, which are
# what make the deny rules apply when Claude is started inside a package
# (`pnpm agents:check` fails CI when one is missing). Only local overrides are
# ignored. These need the `**/` prefix: a pattern containing a slash is anchored
# to this file's directory, so plain `.claude/settings.local.json` does NOT match
# apps/web/.claude/settings.local.json.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/allow-template-scope
**/.claude/shell-snapshots/
**/.claude/todos/
**/.claude/statsig/
**/.claude/history.jsonl
**/.claude/projects/
**/.claude/ide/
# Other agents' local state (rules themselves live in AGENTS.md, committed)
.gemini/settings.local.json
.cursor/mcp.local.json
.aider*
.codex/

# --- Codebase knowledge graph (graphify) -----------------------------------
# Ignored by default; see docs/decisions/INDEX.md 0005. A 5-7MB graph.json
# rewritten on every rebuild is bad git history, and snapshots accumulate
# unpruned (250MB / 38 dated dirs measured in one of our repos).
# If a project decides the graph IS shared infrastructure, invert this
# deliberately and refresh it in CI — replace the line below with:
#   graphify-out/*
#   !graphify-out/graph.json
#   !graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
graphify-out/
